  "prefLabel": "Plc 1104.07 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1104.07 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for initial licensure or who wishes to challenge conditions included in the license shall do so as provided in Plc 304.10.\n\nSource. #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1100.html"
